<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[Project-domain run (model_domain=PROJECT) two of whose on-network links carry a user drive schedule in driveScheduleSecondLink: link 1 (road type 5) a signal approach with a stop, link 2 (road type 4) an on-ramp merge with a per-second grade and a logger dropout, beside link 3 (road type 4) on the average-speed path. LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator walks a schedule second by second (step 100's first arm) and writes its average speed back into Link before ProjectTAG reads it. Source types 21 and 62; running CO, Total Energy and atmospheric CO2, brake wear and tire wear. Snapshot capture supplies the project DB from county-inputs/washtenaw-project-driveschedule/setup-project-driveschedule.sql.]]></description>
